usage: check-example-artifacts.py [-h] [--root ROOT] [--compile]
                                  [--allow-proof-effort {low,medium,high,xhigh,max,ultra}]

Validate FIVE reference artifact links/receipts, without proving propositions.
Run from any directory. Default checks retained metadata and active attempts;
--compile additionally invokes active checkers (and can take several minutes).

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --root ROOT
  --compile             rerun active checkers after metadata passes
  --allow-proof-effort {low,medium,high,xhigh,max,ultra}
                        explicit allowed requested proof effort; repeat for
                        mixed histories; default medium
